{
  "bodyHash": "KlIHoqXLj8A=",
  "content": "![Banner](https://i.imgur.com/zuMquLR.png)\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav/blob/main/LICENSE\"><img alt=\"GitHub 授權\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/gatekeep06/Cobblenav?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=black\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav\"><img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/儲存庫-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=black\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav/wiki\"><img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/維基-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=black\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/gatekeep\"><img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持我-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&labelColor=black\"></a>\n</center>\n\n# 關於模組\nCobblenav 模組靈感來自於遊戲《寶可夢 紅寶石／藍寶石》和《寶可夢 歐米加紅寶石／阿爾法藍寶石》中的道具及相關機制。此模組新增了一台「寶可領航員」，讓你能夠找出當前區域可能出現的寶可夢、牠們的出現機率，以及影響牠們出現的各種因素。模組還允許你透過三維箭頭或名為「寶可追蹤器」的雷達道具來追蹤出現的寶可夢。本模組正在積極開發中，每月都會加入新功能。\n\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>指南</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  以下是維基頁面的連結，你可以在其中找到關於合成、指令、設定以及附加元件建立的資訊。\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/cobblenav/wiki/1.-Recipes\">\n    <img alt=\"合成配方\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zGU6qw1.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/cobblenav/wiki/2.-Commands\">\n    <img alt=\"指令\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xE3IoSv.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/cobblenav/wiki/3.-Configuration\">\n    <img alt=\"設定\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lJssyXW.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/cobblenav/wiki/4.-Add%E2%80%90on-Creation\">\n    <img alt=\"附加元件\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OZ4Z7Tu.png\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n<br>\n如果你是開發者，可能會對<a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav/wiki\">本模組提供的 API 文件</a>感興趣。\n\n# 功能\n\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>位置畫面</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  寶可領航員會告訴你當前位置可以發現哪些寶可夢。\n  <br>\n  準確度掛保證！\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"位置\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/74I9DRg.png\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>搜尋畫面</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  用寶可領航員在你所在區域找到最棒的寶可夢！\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"搜尋\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4HfT8SR.png\">\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>然後追蹤牠的下落！</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"追蹤\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y9iIKOx.png\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LDOW4HM.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>釣魚領航員</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  使用釣魚領航員預測你的漁獲！\n  <br>\n  本模組提供了獨特的釣魚生成檢查功能。\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"釣魚\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cvKVtqd.png\">\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"釣魚領航員\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b9rXJB4.png\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>寶可追蹤器</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  你覺得小地圖不公平或不美觀嗎？試試寶可追蹤器！\n  <br>\n  有了這個小裝置，你就能使用一個易於設定的雷達。\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"寶可追蹤器\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JC9Uxb9.png\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>附加元件相容性</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  本模組與所有使用 Cobblemon 內建寶可夢生成系統的附加元件相容。<br>不確定傳說中的超夢在哪裡可以找到？交給寶可領航員吧！\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"相容\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OLf33cj.png\">\n</center>\n\n# 我的其他模組\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobbleboom\">\n  <img width=160 height=160 alt=\"CobbleBoom\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VWlZyEe.png\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-let-me-spawn\">\n  <img width=160 height=160 alt=\"Cobblemon - Let Me Spawn\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VBgXD5r.png\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/neuromon\">\n  <img width=160 height=160 alt=\"Neuromon\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/71Kzdpa.png\">\n</a>",
